OL,3,AFlydubai co-pilot attacked captain with
OL,4,Aaxe, UAE official says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe co-pilot who attempted to take
OL,7,Fcontrol of a Flydubai plane travelling
OL,8,Fto Israel attacked the pilot with a
OL,9,Fcrash axe, the United Arab Emirates
OL,10,Fprosecutor general has said.
OL,12,FThe flight from Dubai to Tel Aviv
OL,13,Fcarrying more than 170 people plunged
OL,14,F17,000ft (5,200m) two and a half hours
OL,15,Finto its journey, before passengers
OL,16,Fmanaged to overpower the attacker and
OL,17,Fsuccessfully take control of the plane.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
