OL,3,A'Anger in the streets': Tens of
OL,4,Athousands protest in Spain over housing
OL,5,Acrisis
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe measures put forward by Pedro
OL,8,FSanchez's leftist coalition government
OL,9,Fon Friday followed public outcry over
OL,10,Fthe eviction of an 87-year-old woman
OL,11,Ffrom her home last month after she was
OL,12,Funable to afford a sharp rent increase.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
